# firewalla-dns-hardening: DoH IP allow-list
# Installed as /home/pi/.firewalla/config/doh-ips-allow.txt
#
# One IPv4 address (or CIDR) per line. Addresses listed here are removed from
# the DoH block, even after the nightly list update.
# Apply changes with: /home/pi/.firewalla/config/fw-hardening/doh_ipblock.sh reload
#
# Example:
# 203.0.113.10
